-- `fam.activity` — Event keys embed the Brain ID.
+- `fam.activity` — Event keys embed the Brain ID. Platform-authored events (score.changed, run.*) carry a platform event id and are owned by platform.orchestrator (the scorer emits score.changed inside the Orchestrator cycle); Brain events embed the Brain id and are owned by that Brain. platform-authored
 - `fam.health-brains` — Status recorded at the Brain's last execution. Never current health (FD-07); paused Brains keep their last value.
 - `fam.health-jobs` — Brain-written; disposition ORCHESTRATOR_DERIVED (declared legacyDirectWrites).
 - `fam.health-sources` — Writer = the source's owning Brain.
